      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT - $MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ARAD_HOJ_ABBREV(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;)/$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ACTIVE_ABBREV(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;) - $MISSILEWARHEAD_SHORT_BLASTFRAG</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SSM-1 Sparrow HSJ&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 1 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SSM-1 body, which is a nimble space-superiority missile.  This missile will deliver a $MISSILEWARHEAD_DETAIL_BLASTFRAG warhead.  It homes in on its target using a Radar Home-on-Jam seeker  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on an Active Radar seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

$MISSILESTAT_PRIMARYSEEKER: HOME-ON-JAM (&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt; JAMMING Signals Only)
$MISSILESTAT_BACKUPSEEKER: $MISSILESEEKER_MODE_ACTIVE_CAPS &lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;

$MISSILESTAT_SPEED: 290 $UNIT_METERSPERSEC
$MISSILESTAT_DISTANCE: 7,150 $UNIT_METERS
$MISSILESTAT_TOPSPEEDTIME: 0.8 $UNIT_SECONDS
$MISSILESTAT_TURNRATE: 4.5 $UNIT_GS
$MISSILESTAT_TERMINALS: None

$MISSILESTAT_WARHEAD: $MISSILEWARHEAD_DETAIL_BLASTFRAG
